<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>1-Wire Bus on ESPHome - Smart Home Made Simple</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/</link><description>Recent content in 1-Wire Bus on ESPHome - Smart Home Made Simple</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>1-Wire Bus via DS2484</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/ds2484/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/ds2484/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>ds2484&lt;/code> platform provides access to 1-Wire busses via DS2484 device using the &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/i2c">I²C Bus&lt;/a> for
communication.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="code-block">
 &lt;button class="copy-button" aria-label="Copy code">
 &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
 role="none"
 width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
 stroke-linejoin="round">
 &lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2">&lt;/rect>
 &lt;path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1">&lt;/path>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;span class="copy-feedback">&lt;/span>
 &lt;/button>
 &lt;div class="codeblock-content">&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c"># Example configuration entry&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">one_wire&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>- &lt;span class="nt">platform&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">ds2484&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">active_pullup&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>

&lt;h2 id="configuration-variables">
 Configuration variables
 &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore="all" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="copy-link dark-invert" data-anchor="configuration-variables" title="Copy link" src="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/images/link.svg">
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>active_pullup&lt;/strong> (&lt;em>Optional&lt;/em>, defaults to &lt;code>false&lt;/code> ): enables DS2484 &lt;code>active_pullup&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>strong_pullup&lt;/strong> (&lt;em>Optional&lt;/em>, defaults to &lt;code>false&lt;/code> ): enables DS2484 &lt;code>strong_pullup&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>1-Wire Bus via GPIO</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/gpio/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/one_wire/gpio/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>gpio&lt;/code> platform uses the CPU to generate the bus signals on an on-board GPIO pin.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="code-block">
 &lt;button class="copy-button" aria-label="Copy code">
 &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
 role="none"
 width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
 stroke-linejoin="round">
 &lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2">&lt;/rect>
 &lt;path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1">&lt;/path>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;span class="copy-feedback">&lt;/span>
 &lt;/button>
 &lt;div class="codeblock-content">&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c"># Example configuration entry&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">one_wire&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>- &lt;span class="nt">platform&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">gpio&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">pin&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">GPIOXX&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>

&lt;h2 id="configuration-variables">
 Configuration variables
 &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore="all" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="copy-link dark-invert" data-anchor="configuration-variables" title="Copy link" src="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/images/link.svg">
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>pin&lt;/strong> (&lt;strong>Required&lt;/strong>, number): The pin which will be use for bus communication. Note that 1-wire is a bi-directional
bus so the selected GPIO pin must support both input and output. This must be a GPIO pin internal to the
microcontroller and cannot be a pin located on an I/O expander or similar device.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>